/-!
# Eliminating the remaining shadows

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, *The Classification of Quasithin Groups*,
§§11.4–11.5, printed pp. 775–784, combined 1 March 2004 manuscript.

The terminal argument combines abelianness of the normal closure of `V` in
`N_G(V₁)` (11.5.7), the equality `K = L₁` (11.5.8), and nonabelianness under that
equality (11.5.3(3)). The currently imported results prove the elementary
conjugacy and centralizer steps; the terminal argument is not yet formalized.
-/
